{"id":"531644719","kind":"article","title":"穿越时间的文本","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z73hGbYFm7bjV3yYwK29MvbBZEcwK6kWyduqV"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-06-21","updated":"2023-03-08","votes":10,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":536,"keywords":["穿越时间的文本","助记媒介","间隔重复","阅读设计","学习进度"],"summary":"Andy Matuschak 把具有“创制时间维度”的材料称为穿越时间的文本：内容可以跨越一天、依读者的记忆和进度逐步展开。助记媒介、分段连载或先修知识解锁都可让读者与文本保持长期联系，并把复习安排融入阅读体验。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/531644719","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"90hbozvZ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7JZswHPm99BbpTnb7NcP9Rnp8Bs6jsM3zjdv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大众媒介大多缺乏超过一天的创制时间维度</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。这个维度对于创作很是强大，值得探索，例如<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zNmmWtrg5j47Z1CCCSVn7GQhbMf4d3oYj6G\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">指导冥想的应用程序是自然地随时间分散开来</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"dyhX2Dvy\">我们可以把具有创制时间维度的文本称为<b>穿越时间的文本</b>。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"eu0Vq3AH\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7tjqSxGsJ53tXsGkRpchsECWcMsW3sFUw86U\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介使读者与材料保持长久联系</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup><br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"iPbuKSou\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zvzwYeFU3Au4Ya2uVh2k3BUu8udZB7NSrAdL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介可调整为将创制经验逐步展开的形式</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"qXv1LnIb\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zDuEHAJkdvoRuBDxZ6rxcSw9oHTxexywRVt3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" targe